[] TVA 
# TVA (20241223): generate VRTs for 89 HUC8s covering TVA
#   make sure the dem tile coverage file has the same projection as the DEM tiles: EPSG:5070
#   TVA DEM downloaded from usgs, output proj is EPSG:5070. each title has no NODATA.
#   For USGS downloaded DEMs, we must specify nodata when generating VRT: -vrtnodata "-9999"
#   1. create the HUC8 list that covers TVA.
      - sunsphere: process the TVA_PSA.gpkg with /mnt/data/home/yxl/nz-armada/fim_netzero/bin/simplify_tva_psa.py to generate TVA_PSA_singleshape.gpkg and TVA_PSA_singleshape_epsg5070.gpkg
      - on my laptop, use exttract_by_location in qgis to intersect TVA shape with WBD's WBDHU8 layer to generate wbd_huc8_tva.gpkg. I manually removed a few HUC8s that have only tiny overlapped area with TVA.
      - convert wbd_huc8_tva.gpkg to wbd_huc8_tva.csv
      - use pandas to generate HUC8 list:
        df=pd.read_csv('wbd_huc8_tva.csv', dtype={'HUC8':str})
        l=df['HUC8'].to_list()
        l.sort()
        l # save to 
